Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:22.25,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}Riding the whirling winds...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.25,0:21:26.62,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf18}U{\kf27}ta{\kf28}e {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.25,0:21:26.62,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf45}歌{\kf28}え {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.25,0:21:26.62,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:32.55,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf56}Ko{\kf34}e {\kf30}mo {\kf34}to{\kf98}bi{\kf67}ha{\kf53}ne{\kf177}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:32.55,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf90}声{\kf30}も{\kf34}飛{\kf98}び{\kf67}跳{\kf53}ね{\kf177}る
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:32.55,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My voice swoops up and down with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.31,0:00:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.74,0:00:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go. Make me one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.68,0:02:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Granddad used to make them, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, I kind of want my own kitchen knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.85,0:03:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Aren't you a bit young for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They make ones for kids, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.03,0:03:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aw...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, eat up quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.40,0:03:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're leaving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Babies are so cute, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.31,0:03:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My name's Kawachi. I'm a relative of Kaga, Rin-san's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-san... Rin's been living with me for awhile now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.43,0:03:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.34,0:03:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You are Yoshii Masako-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:04:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.61,0:04:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? M-Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.21,0:04:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's something I'd like to talk to you about in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll happily come to you, so just name a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,P-Place? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder... Perhaps in the shopping district, at{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but I don't actually have any idea where you live...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.59,0:04:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,More home-made stuff, Mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.59,0:04:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You made this flower, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. It's called {\i1}embroidery{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, that's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you get a bit older, I'll teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.18,0:04:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.39,0:04:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since you're really good with your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.05,0:05:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't say without meeting her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.94,0:05:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look after Rin for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is important,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so make sure you have a good long chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.76,0:05:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother's been looking forward to seeing Rin-chan, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just as I thought. It's really near Granddad's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.25,0:05:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.54,0:05:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm waiting for someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.35,0:05:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Non-smoking, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.45,0:05:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Watch out. It's going to spill!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.22,0:05:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just keep getting more and more stressed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.51,0:05:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I know how that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Americano, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, one Americano.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will that be all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.44,0:05:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's wonderful, Saionji-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.98,0:05:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just what I'd expect from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, you just need to give each character a couple of traumatic past events...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.24,0:05:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that overdoing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.57,0:06:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it'll be perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why would she go to all the trouble of disappearing completely from Granddad's life...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...if she was just going to live right around the corner from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll leave it to you then, sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.04,0:06:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's pretty careless of someone who's trying to make a getaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.37,0:06:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mum, I have to pee!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:19.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know. I know. Just hold on a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.01,0:06:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Souichi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.70,0:06:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not quite. I'm his grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.37,0:06:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's like a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.44,0:06:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um... Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You just looked so much like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:06:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:07:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone else told me that just a little while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.57,0:07:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though now that I get a closer look...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think Souichi-san looked a bit less rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I brought a photo of Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's one of her from this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,at a rice cake making party at her nursery.{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, she seems sort of...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.57,0:07:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...grown up, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Somebody called you "Sensei" back there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You were watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.78,0:07:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But the name on it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.05,0:07:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I use that name for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.51,0:07:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.39,0:07:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm kind of out of it. It was a busy night last night, and I had to pull an all-nighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did this job pull you away from Rin, then?\N
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.71,0:07:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, you convinced Rin that you were the maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.45,0:08:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But did you do that from the moment she was born?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... It was because of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.74,0:08:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's also true that I was Souichi-san's maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.48,0:08:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I had already decided that I wasn't going to think of her as my daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.94,0:08:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...by the time I became pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.46,0:08:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry, I don't really understand what you're trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My work never sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And just as I finally landed a big job,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.74,0:08:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I learned that I was pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.11,0:08:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not really the sort of job you can have while raising a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.78,0:08:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But Souichi-san told me I should have the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.59,0:08:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I spent my days either working or sleeping, and grew fatter and fatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's strange. When Rin was born, she was so cute, and I couldn't help but love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.37,0:08:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's strange about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I worked myself to the bone trying to raise her and do my job,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.03,0:08:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,all along telling myself I wasn't her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.23,0:08:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it was really tough trying to be a day person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.35,0:08:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There were lots of meetings at night...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...which were impossible to attend unless I was awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I heard Rin spent nights with you at an apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.27,0:09:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you ever go out, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, when I said "night", I meant in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.02,0:09:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd head out once Rin dropped off to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.87,0:09:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And sometimes, I'd have Souichi-san take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.49,0:09:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin sometimes wakes up in the middle of the night, even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.26,0:09:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you never think about how she'd feel if she woke up to find nobody there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But otherwise, how was I supposed to raise a child on my own?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's exactly why Granddad said the three of you should be a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have no objections to me continuing to live with Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm no longer her mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:09:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so I have no right to tell her what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.15,0:10:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though Rin grew inside you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That has nothing to do with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How do you feel about her, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is she important to you or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I do have just one favour to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.82,0:10:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When she goes to school, please let her use your family name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? My family name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.15,0:10:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The other kids might give her a hard time if her guardian's name isn't the same as hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.86,0:10:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could you just promise me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.83,0:10:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I do understand your point,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.22,0:10:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but I can't promise that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.69,0:10:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's been Kaga Rin all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:11:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think you can just change someone's name like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a woman, so I'm not particularly attached to my family name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no telling when it might change, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's a girl, too, so I'm sure she feels the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.54,0:11:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But she's only six.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And besides, that's not really what I'm getting at.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Plus that's just how you feel, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.10,0:11:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's only one thing that matters here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Rin", the name that Souichi-san gave her. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.91,0:11:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.54,0:11:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a man, so I don't really get what you're saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can talk to her about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.12,0:11:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think it's cruel to make a kid that young decide something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.95,0:11:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been thinking about what's best for Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.78,0:11:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I think it'd be more cruel to make that decision for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.93,0:11:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I'm going to ask her what she thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll decide together, and I'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's just no good. No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who could abandon such a cute young girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.91,0:12:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's completely nonsensical!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.83,0:12:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, but she definitely worries about Rin, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that she's a little odd,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.67,0:12:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,or maybe that she doesn't realise the mess she's making for others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.14,0:12:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course a mother's going to worry about her child!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If she really cared, though, she should want to see her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be so rash. She probably has her reasons. Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.17,0:12:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what your granddad ever saw in her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.77,0:12:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that's kind of the least of our problems right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The issue at hand is that she asked me to enrol Rin with my family name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.67,0:12:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. Well I agree with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.16,0:12:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's only natural that a child should have the same name as her guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.15,0:13:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's... Well, I understand that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.37,0:13:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How am I supposed to explain that to Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She already has her own name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, she's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.35,0:13:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When she gets married, her name will change anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.11,0:13:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What "again"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.78,0:13:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If she's just going to go to school and be bullied for her name,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,it'd be better for her just to use ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You think she can just get used to using two names?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, there are all sorts, even in junior school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.87,0:13:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It won't be so unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.26,0:13:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll adopt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.83,0:13:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as she doesn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.61,0:13:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then she really will be Kawachi Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.72,0:13:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it'll be more natural that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.79,0:13:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't talk so flippantly about something that important!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.36,0:13:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not being flippant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to have to decide this sooner or later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It makes no difference if it's now or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down. Calm down...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It does make a difference!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't! It absolutely doesn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.93,0:13:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not going to pass the baton onto anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That'd be too much for Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.33,0:14:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can take anything that comes my way, if it's for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.17,0:14:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But don't use it when I'm not around, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.85,0:14:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you can promise me that, you can use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.03,0:14:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.61,0:14:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about I make you curry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.82,0:14:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's leave it until tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.26,0:14:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? I forget. Do I push? Or pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Give it here a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, yeah, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.59,0:14:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you're really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.65,0:14:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I've been living on my own for a long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.68,0:14:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead and give it a shot.{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.99,0:15:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take it slowly, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't drink the water.{XD}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.90,0:15:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Go in up to your shoulders and count to ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.69,0:15:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One... Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.69,0:15:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One... Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:32.61,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,TL Note: Rin says a cute little counting rhyme here in Japanese. The nonsensical words she's saying contain numbers in Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Saury and mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Three... Four...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Burdock and six alligators.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seven! Eight! Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Five...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.33,0:15:34.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you're too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.23,0:15:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't eat it too quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.45,0:15:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.71,0:15:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.19,0:15:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You make really good curry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.06,0:16:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have to do it that many times?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.43,0:16:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.30,0:16:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I'm not your big brother, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody thinks {\i1}that{\i0}! {Italics on 'that', please. ^^ Sorry, I should learn how. XD}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.70,0:16:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just giving an example! {XD}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.06,0:16:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm asking what you think that makes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.71,0:16:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.08,0:16:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Assuming you don't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh... How do I put this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.82,0:16:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... How about I become your...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.35,0:16:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What would you think if I became your real father?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi... as my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And if we did, your name would be Kawachi Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:17:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi... Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.41,0:17:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.52,0:17:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wouldn't it be better if you had a father?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.30,0:17:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My father is Granddad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.34,0:17:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I like the name Kaga Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same name as Granddad's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.27,0:17:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.28,0:17:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi should just stay as Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.29,0:17:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.89,0:17:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweat! {XD}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.71,0:17:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sweating in March?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.46,0:17:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.10,0:17:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I opened it and you started crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.84,0:17:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said that I wasn't crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Move your head up a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.09,0:17:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know this'll always be your home from now on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.47,0:18:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}We shouldn't forget what we believe in,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}because morning is always just around the corner.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.56,0:18:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}We shouldn't give up on our dreams.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.25,0:18:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They'll all come true someday, for sure!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The first step forward;{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}a step towards tomorrow.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Starting today, everything is new!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.85,0:18:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The first step forward;{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:19:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}a step toward tomorrow.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.37,0:19:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Gather your courage, and take a big step forward!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.02,0:19:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.65,0:20:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to get fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.68,0:20:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care. I'm a waste of a human being, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.45,0:20:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Give me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.53,0:20:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.17,0:22:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Only kids get hugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what Sayaka-chan said.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.92,0:22:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.21,0:22:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even adults have times when they want someone to hug them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.32,0:22:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But they're adults! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.02,0:22:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really know, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.03,0:22:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will it be okay, even once I'm in first grade? {CUTEEEEE. The way she says this in Japanese in d'aaaaaawwwwww}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.43,0:22:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.77,0:22:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll hug you whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.56,0:22:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.11,0:22:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.28,0:22:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I should've hugged you before!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.74,0:22:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll hug you next time you cry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.58,0:22:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.32,0:22:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's getting to the point...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.65,0:22:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.58,0:22:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...where I'm losing track of whether I'm raising Rin,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.45,0:22:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,or whether she's raising me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:22.15,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnFranklin Gothic Book\fs26\b1\pos(658,249)\c&H9C978A&}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.15,0:06:22.27,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnFranklin Gothic Book\fs26\b1\c&H9C978A&\pos(664,246)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.27,0:06:22.40,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnFranklin Gothic Book\fs26\b1\c&H9C978A&\pos(667,246)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:22.94,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnFranklin Gothic Book\fs26\b1\c&H9C978A&\pos(671,246)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:34.76,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial Rounded MT Bold\fs28\frz158.104\c&H8A87EE&\b1\pos(570,414)}Strawberry Kururun
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:34.76,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz159.478\fnArial Rounded MT Bold\fs24\c&H76765D&\pos(681,64)}Saionji Maron
